Z||000005||Monkeyman||10-24-2001||10:06 PM||||Feel free to "borrow" the idea (if it works).  There just isn't enough clearance in my new center console for the HVAC controls.  It was either the stereo up top of the HVAC controls.  Since the HVAC controls are more of a set and forget kind of thing, I opted for those to get relocated.  <P>I'm hoping to be able to find a long enough control cable so that I can use that with the stock HVAC controls.  If not, I'll have to find another slider only control (Vintage Air is the only possibility that comes to mind right now) and mount that under the dash somewhere.  I don't use the temp control that much.  Usually it's either all the way cold or all the way hot.<P>I'll take some pics when I get it finished (which would be much sooner if the weather would cooperate!).||||reg||1
